# Monorepo topology

## Directories

- `apps/` — deployable UIs/CLIs (may depend on `libs/*` only)
- `libs/` — shared packages (org kebab distro → nested import)
- `projects/` — domain jobs / ingest (may depend on `libs/*` only)
- `services/` — reserved for future network services
- `tools/` — `devtools/` + `buildtools/` entrypoints + `resources/` configs, wired by root `poe` tasks
- `dockers/` — shared images / compose
- `docs/` — landing + architecture portal

## Import DAG

- ✅ `apps|projects|services → libs`
- ❌ no app ↔ service, no lib → app/project

## Naming

`libs/rag-core` → import `rag.core` (replace `-` with `.` / `/`).

## New leaves

Hand-add: `pyproject.toml`, `src/`, `tests/`, `docs/`, `ci.yml`, landing card under the matching topology section.
See skill `add-product-leaf` and `docs/ai/add-product-leaf.md`.
